{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pulls/83","id":4795990726,"node_id":"PR_kwDONoernc8AAAABHd0Cxg","html_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pull/83","diff_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pull/83.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pull/83.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/issues/83","number":83,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"[QA3 shadow] Enable canonical Debug tests and add source/PGO contracts","user":{"login":"Ryosuke-Asano","id":73892113,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczODkyMTEz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73892113?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano","html_url":"https://github.com/Ryosuke-Asano","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ryosuke-Asano/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Canonical Debug Runtime builds currently inherit platform-specific tests flags, including Mac --disable-tests. setup-floorp.sh now explicitly enables upstream tests only for debug=true,pgo=false, using qa3_build_profile.enable_debug_tests. PGO generate/use, legacy Debug+PGO and Linux ARM production-opt retain their existing flags. Existing patches, packaging, native verification and publication workflows remain unchanged.\n\nThe independent shadow foundation adds qa3_source_cohort contracts for canonical Git U / Runtime R / ordered common patches and transforms / full common source inventory B, exact diagnostic D/F, target/config/toolchain/artifact/run-attempt subjects, and real profdata/jarlog/workload provenance. External/dangling/excluded symlinks, unrecorded source edits, empty-baseline evidence, mismatched profile subjects and duplicate diagnostic deltas are rejected. No-delta subjects require F=B.\n\nThe PR-only shadow workflow runs generated-config/source/profdata negative tests and recipe preflight. It deliberately emits B/F=null, native/upstream ingestion UNVERIFIED, official Firefox Git/Hg match unverified/advisory, and publicationAuthorized=false. These are contract/preflight records, not native qualification or a trusted attestation.\n\nValidation:\n- 90 local regression tests PASS: 21 new QA3 contracts and 69 existing provenance/profile tests.\n- Actual [shadow job](https://github.com/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/actions/runs/37884218205/job/113670473174), head 81c92fc4bbbc13b4fd4c2a2adaf6a137e342bd53, attempt 1: 21 contracts PASS; preflight and artifact upload PASS; every raw job step succeeded.\n- Five-target tests inspect real generated mozconfigs in temporary workspaces with bootstrap/package-manager stubs. They cover canonical Debug, PGO/LTO/profile paths, legacy Debug+PGO, Linux ARM opt and invalid combinations; they do not run configure or compile.\n- Ruff/format, actionlint, bash syntax and diff checks PASS. Required mach lint/format initialization remains blocked by unrelated include/exclude paths absent from the sparse checkout; failure logs are retained.\n- Independent read-only review: Go for this shadow scope; four initial P2 findings resolved.\n\nThe Library kit's supported materialization returned HTTP 403, so its ZIP/MANIFEST/code and reported 114 tests are not adopted or verified. Actions artifact metadata/upload and decoded job logs were verified; artifact ZIP bytes remain unavailable (HTTP 403). Actual upstream ingestion/common preparation boundaries, native configure/build, test-support/ Mozilla harness and known-bad canaries, all native targets/final signed products, trusted qualification/history/revocation/expiry and publisher gates are follow-up stages. No merge, release, signing, notarization, publication or manual heavy workflow dispatch was performed.\n","created_at":"2026-10-09T04:30:38Z","updated_at":"2026-10-09T05:14:11Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"8c8a7939c16aa85852415b3a51ef7f3f43dceb44","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pulls/83/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pulls/83/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/issues/83/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Floorp-Projects/Floorp-Runtime/statuses/81c92fc4bbbc13b4fd4c2a2adaf6a137e342bd53","head":{"label":"Floorp-Projects:codex/qa3-shadow-foundation","ref":"codex/qa3-shadow-foundation","sha":"81c92fc4bbbc13b4fd4c2a2adaf6a137e342bd53","user":{"login":"Floorp-Projects","id":94953125,"node_id":"O_kgDOBajepQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/94953125?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects","html_url":"https://github.com/Floorp-Projects","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Projects/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Floorp-Proj